This sounds fantastic and horrible.

1. You're making every oldbie's worst nightmare come true.
2. I don't think anybody cares any more.

I have a bunch of stuff to flop down on to the table like so much
trout.

I think we've learned from JCB-itis. We're not going to reinvent the
language every day, but if we want to avoid an inevitable avalanche of
"this sucks I'm going to make my own" until we have loCCan, we need to
just say, "screw it, we're fixing the problems".

Thank you, Robin, for the righteous fire.
=D I stand behind you as long as you keep doing stuff I like, after
which I knife you and steal your spot because I've been standing
behind you the whole time.

